          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation during a commercial flight of bright points moving in the sky: observation of brief sun glints of certain operational satellites of the Starlink® constellation in a specific configuration.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "a4e9c9a44e0c16069f8c40fa688bc32ae8dd2b4dcfbc6c7091dd051f2c84579b"
